IMPORTANT: DATA LICENSING NOTICE

This license applies to the source code, SDK, MCP server, and frontend
application code of Polymer Genomics. It does NOT apply to the data served
through the API.

Data served by Polymer Genomics is aggregated from multiple public databases,
each with its own license. Some data layers carry non-commercial use
restrictions, copyleft obligations, or patent encumbrances. See DATA_LICENSE.md
for the complete data licensing breakdown, including a commercial use
classification for every data source.

The compilation and arrangement of data within the Polymer Genomics database
is a proprietary work of Polymer Genomics. Individual upstream data sources
retain their original licenses.

Per-layer license information is available programmatically at:
  GET /v1/layers/{layer_key}/license

And at: https://polymerbio.org/data-sources
